with glucosamine, sulfate, elcatonin, celebrex, 
levodopa, and gabapentin but these were inef -
fective. Within the year prior to the initial hospi-
tal visit, she had fallen down several times due 
to muscle spasms. The main focus during the 
patient’s visit was SPS, which she reported was 
exacerbated by tension beyond her control and 
vice versa. Upon examination, her pulse rate, 
oxygen saturation, blood pressure, tempera -
