Electromyography (EMG) evaluation showed 
continuous motor unit activity in both agonist 
and antagonist muscles. Electroencephalo-  
graphy (EEG) revealed no epileptic discharge. 
Brain MRI (magnetic resonance imaging) was 
normal. Cancer screening tests were all nega -
