Based on clinical history and the significant 
muscle spasms with stimulation, 0.5 mg clon -
azepam, twice daily, was added to her medi-  
cation regimen. In the next days, the patient 
reported that clonazepam reduced stiffness 
onset. The patient also received intravenous 
immune globulin (10  g/day) for 3 days. Upon 
clonazepam dose increase to 3 times daily,  
she reported reduced frequency of anxiety-trig -
gered spasms and less stiffness. During her 
first hospitalization a CT scan of the thorax 
revealed a 1.0-cm mass in the left inferior lo-</seg>  
